    <item>
      <title>Rideable Lynels</title>
      <author>- Tarnagh -</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/663290</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/663290#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">c9c3fe2c1aebb1906325d79d06510b28ec493fd8</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 14:47:46 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69cd615d6aa27.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69c2ecc2dcebf.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69cd613baa22b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69cd616c05318.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69e21d5ff1619.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69e2219d6fab1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69ee5248b48a5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Rideable Lynels&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: Fix RSDB entry&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;!-- GAMEBANANA HTML --&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h1&gt;Rideable Lynels&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;v2.4.0&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#13;
&lt;small&gt;by &lt;b&gt;Tarnagh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;em&gt;The Giant Horse is gone. In its place: a Lynel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Ride the apex predator of Hyrule - gallop across the plains on a creature&#13;
that was never meant to be tamed. Every hoof strike, every toss of that&#13;
maned head, every burst of speed - all Lynel, all the time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
Custom-retargeted animations, thundering Lynel hoof sounds, a fully custom&#13;
stable portrait and Hyrule Compendium icon, five colour variants including&#13;
an undead Zombie skin, and three jump modes. Install, pick your variant,&#13;
and dominate the overworld on the most terrifying mount in the game.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Features&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full Lynel model&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- the Giant Horse is replaced entirely by a Lynel; idle head movement and native upper body animations are preserved&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Custom portrait and icon&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- the stable screen and Hyrule Compendium display a custom Lynel illustration; no trace of the vanilla Giant Horse image&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Five colour variants&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Red, Blue-Maned, White-Maned, Silver, or Zombie; select in the TKMM option group before merging&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Three jump modes&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- vanilla horse arc, elevated Lynel launch, or an absurd infinite jump that clears any obstacle; select in the TKMM option group&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Retargeted animations&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- leg motion mapped to the Lynel skeleton; the Lynel gallops like a horse&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lynel hoof sounds&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- thundering Lynel footsteps replace the horse audio entirely&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Boosted stats&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- HP 2000, five-star speed, full spurs&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stable-safe&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- boarding, stabling, and NPC interactions work without crashes; the Lynel behaves exactly like the Giant Horse to the game engine&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Colour Variants &lt;small&gt;(TKMM Option Group)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;table&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Red (Junior)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;rust-red hide&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Blue-Maned (Middle)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;blue skin;&lt;b&gt; DEFAULT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;White-Maned (Dark)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;zebra-striped&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Silver (Senior)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;most powerful&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Zombie&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;decayed undead skin; custom painted textures&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Jump Variants &lt;small&gt;(TKMM Option Group)&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;table&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Horse Jump&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;original vanilla horse jump arc&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Normal Lynel Jump&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;launches higher and farther; &lt;strong&gt;DEFAULT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infinite Jump&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;jumps over virtually any obstacle&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Installation&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Open TKMM and add &lt;strong&gt;Rideable_Lynel.tkcl&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;In the option groups, select your colour variant and jump mode&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Merge to SD card - done&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&lt;small&gt;To change variant later: re-select and re-merge. No save file changes needed.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Compatibility&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;table&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Game version&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;TotK 1.0.0+ (tested on 1.2.0 and 1.4.3)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Nintendo Switch (Atmosphère / TKMM)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
  &lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conflicts&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;Any mod that modifies &lt;strong&gt;GameRomHorse00L.pack.zs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&#13;
&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Known Issues&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
&lt;ul&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;Upper body animations are too stiff in canter and gallop&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
  &lt;li&gt;On save reload the Lynel sometimes does not appear&lt;/li&gt;&#13;
&lt;/ul&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Videos&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h3&gt;Community Showcase &lt;small&gt;by The Hidden Yiga Clan - mod version v2.1.0&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&#13;
&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZpNVK_8hb2A" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hyu5dTi2Sls" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/KErI_o5oaB0" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/bEjSC4-e8zI" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Y1hXNfmNtxw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
&#13;
&lt;h2&gt;Credits&lt;/h2&gt;&#13;
Mod by &lt;b&gt;Tarnagh&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#13;
Tools: Python, oead, byml, zstandard, TKMM</description>
