      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:36:01 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e6e49e09.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e6eadaf3.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e6f1d02d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa22e7ddb07c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Self Recall&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Recent Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Switch support now works under "self-recall-v1.0.9-switch".&lt;/b&gt; It has a reduced recall time interval (30s) to fit into memory on Switch. There are other known issues you can find on the &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/self-recall" target="_blank"&gt;GitHub&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Emulator users can use "self-recall-v1.0.9-emulator"&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Activate with ZL + Right-Joystick-Click. &lt;/b&gt;This new keybind avoids a conflict with UltraCam.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mod now occupies the subsdk8 slot instead of subsdk9. This &lt;b&gt;prevents conflicts with other mods&lt;/b&gt; enabling you to run more mods alongside this one. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Description&lt;/h1&gt;Self recall lets you rewind Link through his recent traversal history. An muted background effect is applied, a golden ribbon showing your historical trail shows and animations run in reverse. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;ZL+Dpad-Down to activate.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Speed&lt;/h2&gt;By default, self-recall will run in reverse at 1.25x speed. By wearing upgraded articles of clothing from the Glide set, you can increase the speed. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;0 articles -&gt; 1.25x &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 article -&gt; 1.5x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;2 articles -&gt; 2x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;3 articles -&gt; 4x&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Every upgraded version of the Glide Mask, Glide Shirt and Glide Tights counts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Caveats&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Only works on version 1.2.1 of the game.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Recalling through an Ascend works - but is almost always a glitchy experience. I decided to leave it in for the novelty factor.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Switch specific issues:&lt;br&gt;      - 4x/2x recall speed can be choppy. &lt;br&gt;      - Recall duration reduced from 65 seconds to 30 seconds.&lt;br&gt;      - Link's torso, head, legs or armor may disappear during a recall. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;	&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Code and Detailed README&lt;/h2&gt;MIT Licensed source code and a &lt;b&gt;far more in-depth mod description available &lt;a href="https://github.com/afiaka87/totk-mods/tree/main/self-recall" target="_blank"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;Relied heavily on astra for this.</description>
