TKMM)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Master Deity Sword&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Link - Warrior of Sunlight&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Link of the Silent Sorrow&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;- below you can put any other mod that edits the mentioned file above :D&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pray at the Sunlight Altar, defeat the mightiest dragons ! and become a Warrior of Sunlight !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The armor pieces are located in the king gleeok sky islands ! defeat all of them, claim their horns and prove your worth at the altar !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;Once you complete the quest, the Sunlight Altar is gonna give you the weapons, to get the sunlight blade getting the armor is a must !&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- New Item added - The Sunlight Blade miracle ! does 60 dmg when fused and has fire\electric attacks, invisible fuse, doesn't hide the blade and grants flames on swing !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sunlight Talisman has a glowy particle effect, does 5 physical + electric damage and can cast the mighty Sunlight Spears at full power that do 60 dmg, veryeffective against evil !&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Sunlight Straight Sword has the Master Sword buff and can also shoot a less powerful version of the sunlight spear with R button, has 2x times fuse, with the power of the sun cleanse evil forces from hyrule!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div class="SelectedElement"&gt;- Sunlight Shield is frictionless and 100% unbreakable !  , and shockproof&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Iron helm grants 100% electric elemental protection &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Armor of the sun grants 100% heat/fire resistance&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Iron leggings grants 100% cold /freeze resistance, + some bonus effects (some are secret jeje)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- All armorpieces grant their respective elemental combat bonuses :D, all together grant the 4 miasma guard hearts &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Sunlight Altar can be found at the highest spot at the Great Sky Island (above the Room of Awakening)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In case you lost, or decide to display the weapons at Link´s house they acquired again :D&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;if you encounter any issue let me know :D</description>
