      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f56d6978b0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f56fc3e48f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f57097580c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Removed Infinite Durability&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Removal&lt;/em&gt;: Removed infinite weapon durability as it was causing glitches with shrine entrances.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Atop Eventide Island, there is an Old Man who can change the rules of the world around you!&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Nobody knows where he came from, or why he is there, but he has options for the following:&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Durability:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Restore &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;equipped&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/u&gt; PRISTINE Weapon/Shield/Bow durability &lt;i&gt;(ONLY for vanilla game items)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Other:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Health &lt;i&gt;(40 Hearts)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Stamina&lt;i&gt; (3 Wheels)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Battery &lt;i&gt;(16 batteries/48 cells)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Slots - &lt;i&gt;Weapon (20)/Bow (14)/Shield (20)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Ambient Healing &lt;i&gt;(1/4 Heart per 15 seconds)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Toggle Fast Travel &lt;i&gt;(Warp)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Trigger Bloodmoon&lt;br&gt;- +1 Free random max level/30 min meal per day &lt;i&gt;(Made from recipes containing dragon parts)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inventory:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Max Arrows&lt;br&gt;- Max Rupees&lt;br&gt;- 250K Poes&lt;br&gt;- 250K Zonaite Ore&lt;br&gt;- 250K Crystallized Charges&lt;br&gt;- 152 Blessings&lt;br&gt;- 147 Bubbul Gems&lt;br&gt;- 20 Sage's Will&lt;br&gt;- 3 Warp Points.&lt;i&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Weapon Shop:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;i&gt;(Exchangeable items only show once you have collected at least 1 of them)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Exchange Decayed for Pristine&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Show Map Locations:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt; (Once shown, they cannot be hidden again)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Shrines&lt;br&gt;- Lightroots&lt;br&gt;- Skyview Towers + Land &amp;amp; Sky Map Regions&lt;br&gt;- Stables&lt;br&gt;- Villages&lt;br&gt;- Bargainer Statues&lt;br&gt;- Great Fairys&lt;br&gt;- Dragon Tears&lt;br&gt;- Various POIs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;TKMM required for installing &amp;amp; only tested on TotK v1.2.1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;(Should work on all update versions of the game)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;This was originally created to fulfil requests or to add options which were useful during different playthroughs and I want to give a MASSIVE thanks to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;a class="MemberLink" href="https://gamebanana.com/members/4593678" data-id="member_4593678"&gt;cargocult&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;for all the help, guidance and contributions in making this mod and also to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;a class="MemberLink" href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2537238" data-id="member_2537238"&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/upic/6655992836eca.png" alt="Real Princess Zelda uPic" class="Upic" aria-describedby="tippy-12"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;i&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the Ambient Healing Mod.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
