      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9b3a0ebf525.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69f53bf609e66.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/69f53bf5c9918.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Svengoolie&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Svengoolie is now included!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Game text modified to reflect having Svengoolie instead of Mastro.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I had intended to include this in the original upload, but due to stupidity on my part I thought it was not working properly.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I had forgot that I was running game version 1.2.0 on my switch emunand while all my development work was on game version 1.2.1 that I dumped from my sysnand. LOL oh well.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;Svengoolie and the Dinfernos are a performance group expressing power through music and character performance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Svengoolie reigns as the king of horror hilarity on &lt;a href="https://www.metv.com/svengoolie/" target="_blank"&gt;MeTV!&lt;/a&gt; You should check it out!&lt;br&gt; &lt;br&gt;This mod is compatible with music mods such as the ones on &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/collections/186946"&gt;The Stable Trotters Songlist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod changes and adds the following:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;New hair Styles for the musicians.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Pyper: standalone hair model. Black Hair. - model and Umii edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Beetz: New hairstyle. Black Hair - Umii edit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Eustus: New hairstyle. Black Hair - Umii edit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Violynne: Black Hair - Umii edit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Modified clothing for the Musicians&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Removed horseshoe belt buckles from models - model edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;All metal colors changed to silver - texture edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Eustus: No Glasses&lt;/b&gt; - Umii edit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Black Lipstick&lt;/b&gt; - Umii edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Game Text modified&lt;/b&gt; - MSBT edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;changed "Stable Trotters" to "Dinfernos"&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="SelectedElement"&gt;changed "Stable Heroes" to "Blazing Dinfernos"&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;changed "Stable Gallopers" to "Stable Trotters"&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Mastro changed to Svengoolie&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;References to the rubber chicken&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Svengoolie&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Model modified to remove extra hair and mustache&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li class="SelectedElement"&gt;Texture edits&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;An entry to &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/jams/206"&gt;Triforce of Power Jam&lt;/a&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://files.gamebanana.com/bitpit/please3.png"&gt;</description>
