      <guid isPermaLink="false">03b7fc4db05b74ead5c9a6a91bedfaa5a422f353</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:40:45 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a99e70acc4a4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a99e7090474c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a99e70941d1b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a99e70968192.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a99e70b3a4a4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Zonai Survey v0.1.2&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;v0.1.2 changes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fixed crash in Ryubinx&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Switch-specific fixes (failed to work)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;Pressing &lt;b&gt;ZL + D-pad Up&lt;/b&gt; starts a Death-Stranding-inspired scan/survey that labels items in front of you by ~440m.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Installation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Emulator (Citron/Ryujinx)&lt;/h3&gt;Download zonai-survey-v0.1.2.zip. Open the game's mod or load directory for title 0100F2C0115B6000 and extract the archive there. It should produce zonai-survey/exefs/ and zonai-survey/romfs/. Keep both directories. Enable zonai-survey in the game's add-ons list.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Switch Hardware&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;br&gt;Currently Switch hardware doesn't work and is unsupported.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Limitations&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;This ONLY runs on version 1.2.1 of TotK.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;This is a "subsdk9" mod - it can and will conflict/break other similar mods when enabled at the same time. One solution to this is to compile the source here alongside your other mods, but you would need to respect various polling systems to make sure they work together.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;The far field becomes sparse as the game streams less collision at distance.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;FPS currently may take a dip depending on hardware and choice of emulator. In my testing this goes from a 0 fps hit to as much as 5 fps. It could be even more on (for instance) Swithc hardware).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Source and license&lt;/h2&gt;Zonai Survey is GPL-2.0-only. The text renderer and part of the overlay hook are&lt;br&gt;derived from &lt;a href="https://github.com/aquacluck/totk-lotuskit" target="_blank"&gt;totk-lotuskit&lt;/a&gt; by aquacluck&lt;br&gt;and its contributors. See &lt;a href="//NOTICE"&gt;NOTICE&lt;/a&gt; for full attribution.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;Sol and Fable were used during development.</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/zonai-survey-v011.zip" type="application/zip"/>
