      <guid isPermaLink="false">a39f7afd894ae628f8f94e00bb66f48a4c8856dc</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 04:39:35 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/691c028977e93.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/691bfc27c6bf0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/691bfc27abcf5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/691bfc4d2f7b5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a96541c56093.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/691bfc4a85fac.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a96541c6d8d5.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a96541c85bb2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a96541c8d996.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Model updates/Weapon functionality fixes&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;In this update of the mod, I have updated the model of the &lt;span class="BlueColor"&gt;Master Sword of the Sky&lt;/span&gt;, and it's sheath, so they use the original &lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;HD cutscene models&lt;/span&gt; from Skyward Sword. HUGE thanks to &lt;a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2179535"&gt;KBOMB&lt;/a&gt; for his help with that!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The AINB for the Master Sword of the Sky has been edited, removing the True Awakened state, but keeping the half awakened state, which I think is more lore accurate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The AINB used to give the White Sword of the Sky the Master Sword beam has also been edited, so the Master Sword's awakened states/buffs have been completely removed from it, which keeps it cleaner, and lore accurate.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enjoy!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Improvement&lt;/em&gt;: Both the weapon and the sheath's models have been updated&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: The Master Sword of the Sky no longer has the fully awakened state&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: The White Sword of the Sky is now stable, and only has the Master Sword beam&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since Skyward Sword was the first Zelda game I've ever played, I've always loved anything and everything to do with it, especially the Master Sword. I especially love its final two forms it takes in its development during Skyward Sword. TOTK already has the final form the Master Sword takes, and several mods tweak the Master Sword to look more like Skyward Sword, or add a Skyward Sword version of it, so I made this mod, which brings the player the Master Sword in it's second to last form.&lt;br&gt;      It functions exactly like the base game Master Sword, yet is its own standalone weapon. It even features the blue flashes when facing Ganondorf and Phantom Ganon, etc. &lt;br&gt;      Both the White Sword and the Master Sword of the Sky have the GuardEnhance subtype, so they can parry like a shield, and the White Sword now has DefeatMiasma as well. I've also given the Master Sword of the Sky ChargeSpeedUp, and DecreaseChargeAttackStamina.&lt;br&gt;      This mod also makes the Hylian Shield have invisible fuses, (not ghost fuses, for whatever reason, they're just invisible unless parrying), add DivingMobilityUp to the Skyward Sword armor set and adds the ghost fuse and will eventually add the Master Sword beam to the White Sword of the Sky (by eventually, I mean whenever I figure it out), making the entire Skyward Sword set more accurate. (I can make a variant without the extra features for anyone who wishes.)&lt;br&gt;      Enjoy!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;      I have only tested this on TOTK version 1.1.0, you may have to recalculate the RESTBL for other version compatibility.&lt;br&gt;      Please inform me if you notice any issues, and I will attempt to fix them, and if anyone can help me figure out how to give the White Sword of the Sky the Master Sword beam, I'd appreciate advice.</description>
