ebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fcb9dd8a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fcbbb2dd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fcbbffde.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fcbec7c7.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fd8ddcca.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdaab974.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdac2470.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdb235e4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdb4a35f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdb6b111.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdbeee12.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f423c2efab.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f423c3c274.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f423c454aa.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f423cc05ff.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9f3fdc4fa29.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; 2.0.0&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Version 2.0.0 is currently only available as early access on my patreon, same version will be uploaded here automatically within the 30 days time limit, the early access can be found &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://www.patreon.com/PotatoFried/posts/depths-of-v2-0-168119564"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;here.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: - [Feature]: New [Scene Overhaul: Ceiling] tkcl option&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: - [Feature]: New [Scene Overhaul: Field] tkcl option&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: - [Feature]: New [Diverse Trees] tkcl option&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: - [Feature]: New [Deep Cycles] tkcl option&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: - [Feature]: New [Increased Fog] tkcl option&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Feature&lt;/em&gt;: - [Feature]: New [Balanced] tkcl option under biomes&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New zonaite management system&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: An initial stage of an outpost based crafting system.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Central Hyrule] region outpost.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Faron] region outpost.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wraith] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Spirit] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Crystal] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Coral] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wanderer] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Zonai] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lava] enemy tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Spirit] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Coral] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wanderer] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Zonai] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lava] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Swordsman] armor set.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wraith] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Spirit] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Coral] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Wanderer] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lava] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Elite Guard] weapon tier.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Fragments of the Past] quest.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Hebra] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Gerudo Highlands] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Gerudo] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Central Hyrule] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Eldin] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Lanayru] regional mounts.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: - [Addition]: New [Faron] regional mount.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: A way to re-obtain the [Infamous Servant] set of weapons have been implemented.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: The [Tainted Armos Heart] is now a fire material&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: The [Abyssal] lynel now wields the [Spirit] set of weapons&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Adjustment&lt;/em&gt;: - [Adjustment]: Several other smaller adjustments were made.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: - [Bugfix]: Gigantic plants pop-in issues and graphical issues on the giant mushrooms were fixed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bugfix&lt;/em&gt;: - [Bugfix]: Some things I no longer remember.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe width="560" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/iMcYl_k4pKM" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://discord.gg/gmfhR4pgtG" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Discord Server.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.patreon.com/PotatoFried" target="_blank"&gt;My Patreon if you want to support and/or gain early access to projects.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://depths-of-the-kingdom.fandom.com/wiki/Depths_of_the_Kingdom_Wiki" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Depths of the Kingdom wiki.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1p80n0A7ugWwYM43GguqM7GiHT-umLo4tiR28cOVj-OQ/edit?usp=sharing" class="SelectedElement" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Spreadsheet by Smbai.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Description:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;This project resembles our vision at making the entirety of the underground what it should have been, an unknown mystic place filled with dangerous enemies and unreal environments.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Main Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Several new enemies increasing enemy variety all over the Depths, including new mini-bosses, all of these based on existing lore and respecting the original art style.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Several new items.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New obtainable, upgradable armour sets and weapons.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;New quests and locations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Revamps some of the chests.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Revamps all enemy camps.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Brand new wildlife exclusive to the Depths environments.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overhauls the whole Depths environment, adding over 11 new region-based biomes without breaking the original atmosphere, enhanced scenery and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Overhauls the grass.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Languages:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Chinese.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;English.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;French.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;German.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Japanese.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Spanish.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Compatibility:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;The mod has been successfully tested on both emulators and console, this version of the mod was made for version 1.4.2, there is a tkcl available at &lt;a href="https://discord.com/invite/gmfhR4pgtG" target="_blank"&gt;discord &lt;/a&gt;which will work with other versions, aside from also offering customizable mod features.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;- Compatible with CM by using a dedicated patch, available at Discord.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;- Compatible with Hyrule Rebeautified, please place DOTK above Rebeautified on TKMM merge order.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="GreenColor"&gt;- Compatibility patch coming soon for Playable Riju Mod, more details coming soon.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;- Mod is not compatible with The Second Quest&lt;/span&gt;</description>
